        {
          "id": 657305383,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This is a separate fix from the interface information fix.\n\nAnd, for the interface information fix, you'd want to add\n\n```\n    { WTAP_BLOCK_IF_ID_AND_INFO, MULTIPLE_BLOCKS_SUPPORTED, OPTIONS_SUPPORTED(interface_block_options_supported) },\n```\n\nwith `interface_block_options_supported` being\n\n```\n/* Options for interface blocks. */\nstatic const struct supported_option_type interface_block_options_supported[] = {\n    /* No comments, just an interface name. */\n    { OPT_IDB_NAME, ONE_OPTION_SUPPORTED }\n};\n```",
