          "id": 657641293,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I was playing around with that but could not figure out what exactly would be correct. What is the difference between `ONE_BLOCK_SUPPORTED` and `MULTIPLE_BLOCKS_SUPPORTED` for the WTAP_BLOCK_PACKET?\n\nI can add the `WTAP_BLOCK_IF_ID_AND_INFO`.\n\nbtw: I cannot make dragging multiple files into Wireshark work for BLF since BLF does not have all the interface blocks defined at the start of the file but I need to learn interfaces on the fly. Wireshark seems to not accept that. Is that something I can configure too?",
