          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "WTAP_BLOCK_IF_ID_AND_INFO is changed in latest change.\n\nI will create a new merge request for ONE_BLOCK_SUPPORTED vs MULTIPLE_BLOCKS_SUPPORTED.\n\nThe selecting and dragging multiple files will be an issue for another merge request, if I can figure it out. later.\n\nSo, I can resolve the thread.",
